[h1]SaucedCarts v2.1.21[/h1]

[h1]Carts stop disappearing[/h1]
[list]
[*]Carts left on the ground no longer vanish on servers that clean up dropped items. This covers every way a cart ends up on the ground, including carts you found and used where they stood, and carts the game drops for you when you die, fall, or climb through a window.
[/list]

[h1]Fixes[/h1]
[list]
[*]You can push a cart that is inside a bag (somehow, even though it shouldn't be there), whether the bag is in your inventory or on the ground.
[*]Corpses taken out of a cart land where you drop them and can be picked up again.
[*]Corpse loading works properly in multiplayer, and bodies no longer get left behind where you grabbed them.
[*]Weight Reduction can now be set to 100, so a cart's contents weigh nothing.
[*]Pushing a cart no longer sends constant updates to the server.
[/list]

[h1]Loot[/h1]
[list]
[*]Carts that spawn with items now follow your server's loot settings, including rarity and banned items. Rarer categories are replaced with other fitting items instead of leaving the cart empty.
[/list]

[h1]Good to know[/h1]
[list]
[*]Weight Reduction lowers the weight of what's inside the cart, not the cart itself. Carrying too much can injure you, which lowers how much you can carry for a while, even after you put the load down.
[*]Save-safe. In multiplayer, update the server and every player.
[*]Corpse storage is still an opt-in beta, off by default.
[/list]
